    ?banned a owl:Class .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:TerritorialSea, ContinentalShelf, HighSeas MUST NOT exist as owl:Class -- permanently refactored to value individuals. Mirrors test_maritime_overlay_types_are_values_not_subclasses (rejected part)." .

