ASK { gmeow:stateReferenceFrame a owl:FunctionalProperty . }""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:stateReferenceFrame MUST be owl:FunctionalProperty. Mirrors test_state_reference_frame_is_functional." .

