    gmeow:virtualLocationTypeWebsite         a gmeow:VirtualLocationType .
    gmeow:virtualLocationTypeSocialMediaPage a gmeow:VirtualLocationType .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "The four core VirtualLocationType seed individuals MUST exist. Mirrors test_virtual_location_type_is_value_not_subclass (seeds part)." .

