    gmeow:refOriginBarycentric     a gmeow:CelestialReferenceOrigin .
    gmeow:refOriginHeliocentric    a gmeow:CelestialReferenceOrigin .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:CelestialReferenceOrigin MUST be a subclass of logic:QualityValue; four seed individuals MUST exist. Mirrors test_reference_position_and_timescale_are_values." .

# --- 85. ICRS, FK5, Galactic frames exist with celestial realm (MUST) ---------
