    gmeow:celestialEpoch a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
        rdfs:domain gmeow:CelestialCoordinates .
}""" ;
    gmeow:saRationale "gmeow:rightAscension, declination, and celestialEpoch MUST be DatatypeProperties with domain CelestialCoordinates. Mirrors test_celestial_coords_have_ra_dec_epoch." .

